<title>INDIA: India TISCO board to meet on October 31.</title>
<headline>India TISCO board to meet on October 31.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The board of directors of Tata Iron and Steel Company Ltd (TISCO) will meet on October 31 to finalise the unaudited results for the half year ended September 30, 1996, the company said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
